§§ `GC11: cancellation and refunds (src:947-962), forks F-short-period, F-gc11-refund, F-gc11-pro-rata`

-- The Insured cancels; annual premium 4,000,000, all paid.
GIVEN `ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` `ends on` MEANS
    `GC11: the refund to an Insured who cancels, under` `the owner's policy` `with effect on` `ends on`

-- Exactly 3 months: 30%, 1,200,000 kept, 2,800,000 back. One day more: 60%, 1,600,000 back.
#ASSERT `the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` (YMD 2026 4 1) EQUALS 2_800_000
#ASSERT `the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` (YMD 2026 4 2) EQUALS 1_600_000
#ASSERT `the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` (YMD 2026 7 1) EQUALS 1_600_000
#ASSERT `the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` (YMD 2026 7 2) EQUALS 400_000
#ASSERT `the owner's refund on cancelling, effective` (YMD 2026 10 2) EQUALS 0
-- Premium paid below the short-period premium: no refund, and nothing more is owed.
#ASSERT `GC11: the refund to an Insured who cancels, under` (`The policy` WITH `the Policy Summary` IS `the 2026 Summary`, `the Insured` IS `an Insured born 15 June 1980, a tenant` FALSE, `the premises` IS `a brick house`, `issued to a company` IS FALSE, `the Insured also has Personal Accident cover` IS FALSE, `the Insurer agreed to issue a Certificate or the Policy Summary` IS TRUE, `the Insurer received and accepted a completed Proposal Form` IS TRUE, `the premium was paid in full within the prescribed time` IS FALSE, `the premium paid` IS 1_000_000) `with effect on` (YMD 2026 7 2) EQUALS 0

-- The Insurer cancels: pro rata. Premium paid 3,650,000 for 365 days; in force from 1 January
-- to 2 July 2026 is 182 days; refund 3,650,000 x 183/365 = 1,830,000.
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a policy with 3,650,000 paid` MEANS
    `The policy` WITH
        `the Policy Summary`                                     IS `the 2026 Summary`
        `the Insured`                                            IS `an Insured born 15 June 1980, a tenant` FALSE
        `the premises`                                           IS `a brick house`
        `issued to a company`                                    IS FALSE
        `the Insured also has Personal Accident cover`           IS FALSE
        `the Insurer agreed to issue a Certificate or the Policy Summary` IS TRUE
        `the Insurer received and accepted a completed Proposal Form`     IS TRUE
        `the premium was paid in full within the prescribed time`         IS TRUE
        `the premium paid`                                       IS 3_650_000

#ASSERT `GC11: the refund when the Insurer cancels, under` `a policy with 3,650,000 paid` `with effect on` (YMD 2026 7 2) EQUALS 1_830_000
#ASSERT `GC11: the refund when the Insurer cancels, under` `a policy with 3,650,000 paid` `with effect on` (YMD 2026 1 1) EQUALS 3_650_000
#ASSERT `GC11: the refund when the Insurer cancels, under` `a policy with 3,650,000 paid` `with effect on` (YMD 2027 1 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `GC11: the day an Insurer's cancellation takes effect, the notice sent on` (YMD 2026 12 15) EQUALS YMD 2027 1 14

